      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_7ed53b416005d5d4_1",
        "edit": "Replace the sum assignment `assign s=(~(a&b)&ci);` with the correct full-adder XOR sum `assign s=(a^b)^ci;`. The original expression ignored a and b in the sum term, producing wrong s values (e.g., cycle2 got 00 expected 01, cycle3 got 11 expected 10). The carry assignment is unchanged.",
        "lens_id": "dataflow_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module fa_behavioral(a,b,ci,s,co);\n       input a,b;\n       input ci;\n       output  s;\n       output co;\n\n\n\n       assign s=(a^b)^ci;\n       assign co=((a&b)|(a&ci)|(b&ci));\n\n\n\nendmodule\n",
